1 both hold 0 ETH, so they can't pay for the swaps unless I bridge some ETH over first. That adds $2.80. The alternative of swapping WBTC to USDC on Ethereum and bridging USDC would cost about $5.30 for the Arbitrum half, so this route is cheaper.\n- **Gas on eth1:** it keeps well over the 0.0003 ETH per transaction it needs.\n- **Execution:** I'll run the legs one at a time. After each leg confirms, I'll read the destination balance before the next. I'll re-quote the later legs if the WBTC amount from leg 1 differs from the quote or a quote expires.\n\nApprove to proceed, or tell me if you'd like a different route or cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_12"},"id":"toolu_01VJvtsqmKviUfq9SLuP2aYX"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_13\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01VJvtsqmKviUfq9SLuP2aYX","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_13"},"id":"toolu_012HNsx8tqeMbBFBBSjMkfhv"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_012HNsx8tqeMbBFBBSjMkfhv","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_01PxBZygvvD4FpmyQynimHuF"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01PxBZygvvD4FpmyQynimHuF","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"